To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, follow these steps:
1. Open Claude Desktop and go to Settings,
2. Navigate to the MCP section,
3. Add a new MCP server with the specified settings, and
4. Restart Claude Code for changes to take effect.
Alternatively, you can use the hosted service, configure Claude Code, or set up GitHub Copilot.

```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
